{"kind": "daily", "period": "2026-10-25", "prepared_on": "2026-10-25", "html": "<div style=\"font-family:-apple-system,'PingFang TC','Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;color:#16213e;\">\n<div style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#1a2b4a;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;padding-left:12px;margin:0 0 18px;\">📰 每日 AI 新聞 Top 10 · 2026-10-25</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f2f6e8;border-left:5px solid #88a83f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#88a83f;font-weight:800;\">1.</span> OpenAI says it will no longer train its AI models on the live internet, citing \"significant risks\"<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6e8c28;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenAI 宣布不再以即時網路資料訓練模型，理由是「重大風險」</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI will cut frontier models off from the internet, weeks after one of its engineers said that solution wouldn't work.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 將讓前沿模型與網際網路隔離，而就在幾週前，該公司一名工程師才說過這個做法行不通。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/23/openai-says-it-will-no-longer-train-its-ai-models-on-the-live-internet-citing-significant-risks/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f9edf6;border-left:5px solid #c56bb0;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#c56bb0;font-weight:800;\">2.</span> The PHP Meltdown Shows How AI Makes Bugs More Exploitable<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b04b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">PHP 風暴顯示 AI 如何讓漏洞更容易被利用</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Security researchers used AI tools to help uncover years-old vulnerabilities in PHP. Then the AI-assisted attacks began.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">資安研究人員借助 AI 工具找出 PHP 存在多年的漏洞，隨後 AI 輔助的攻擊便接踵而至。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Wired</b> · <a href=\"https://www.wired.com/story/kernel-panic-the-php-meltdown-shows-how-ai-makes-bugs-more-exploitable/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#eef4ff;border-left:5px solid #5b8def;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#5b8def;font-weight:800;\">3.</span> Securing our frontier model training environment<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#3b6cf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">強化我們的前沿模型訓練環境安全</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI explains how it strengthened containment for frontier model training and evaluation, including offline environments and high-compute red-teaming.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">OpenAI 說明如何強化前沿模型訓練與評估的隔離措施，包括離線環境與高算力紅隊演練。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">OpenAI</b> · <a href=\"https://openai.com/index/securing-our-frontier-model-training-environment\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#ecf7ef;border-left:5px solid #4caf72;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#4caf72;font-weight:800;\">4.</span> Jack Dorsey's Block made an AI model that talks to you like an awkward new friend<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#1e9e57;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">模型</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Block 推出語音模型 Dessa，說話像個有點尷尬的新朋友</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Block announced Dessa, a model trained \"from scratch on nothing but human conversation.\" TechCrunch reports it can run locally on a MacBook M4 Max.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Block 發表 Dessa，完全以人類對話從零訓練。TechCrunch 指出它可在 MacBook M4 Max 上本機執行。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1017906/jack-dorsey-block-dessa-ai-voice-speech\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#f1ecfb;border-left:5px solid #8a6bd8;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#8a6bd8;font-weight:800;\">5.</span> Pennsylvania will require labels on AI-generated ads<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#6b3bf6;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">賓州將要求 AI 生成廣告必須標示</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Governor Josh Shapiro signed the Artificial Intelligence Deceptive Advertising Act, requiring disclosures on any ad significantly modified or generated by AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">州長 Josh Shapiro 簽署《人工智慧欺騙性廣告法》，凡經 AI 大幅修改或生成的廣告（圖像、影片、音訊或文字）都須揭露。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">The Verge</b> · <a href=\"https://www.theverge.com/ai-artificial-intelligence/1018187/pennsylvania-ai-deceptive-advertising-act\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f6f5;border-left:5px solid #2bb0a6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#2bb0a6;font-weight:800;\">6.</span> Updated Google privacy policy says your Gmail might be used for advertising<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#0f9b9b;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">政策</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Google 更新隱私政策：你的 Gmail 可能被用於廣告</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Turning on Personal Intelligence gives the company more data for ad targeting.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">開啟 Personal Intelligence 後，Google 會取得更多可用於廣告投放的資料。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">Ars Technica</b> · <a href=\"https://arstechnica.com/gadgets/2026/10/updated-google-privacy-policy-says-your-gmail-might-be-used-for-advertising/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fbf3e3;border-left:5px solid #d99b3f;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#d99b3f;font-weight:800;\">7.</span> Forced to pick, Grok's AI model chooses Republicans. OpenAI's picks Democrats.<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#b9791f;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">研究</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">被迫選邊時，Grok 選共和黨，OpenAI 選民主黨</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">A new study found the two models disagreed in more than 90% of nearly 500 election races.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">一項新研究發現，在近 500 場選舉中，兩個模型的推薦有超過 90% 不一致。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">TechCrunch</b> · <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/24/forced-to-pick-groks-ai-model-chooses-republicans-openais-picks-democrats/\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fdeef0;border-left:5px solid #e0738a;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#e0738a;font-weight:800;\">8.</span> 1Password expands AI agent login support, with Muse and Grok Bot first<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#d83a5e;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產品</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">1Password 擴大 AI 代理登入支援，Muse、Grok Bot 率先整合</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">1Password for Agents extends agent login support beyond Claude. Once users consent, agents can log into sites without seeing the password.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">1Password for Agents 將代理登入支援從 Claude 擴及其他服務；使用者同意後，AI 代理即可登入網站執行任務，無需直接取得密碼。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179942\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#edeefb;border-left:5px solid #6b72d6;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#6b72d6;font-weight:800;\">9.</span> OpenSSF releases guidance on AI vulnerability handling, stressing validation and human review<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#5159c9;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">資安</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">OpenSSF 發布 AI 漏洞處理指引，強調漏洞驗證與人工審查</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">The guidance gives practical advice for developers and researchers using AI to find and fix vulnerabilities, as attackers also adopt AI.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">指引為使用 AI 尋找與修補漏洞的開發人員與研究人員提供實務建議，因為攻擊者也已開始利用 AI。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179863\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#e8f4fb;border-left:5px solid #3f97c9;border-radius:10px;padding:13px 16px;margin-bottom:11px;\">\n  <div style=\"font-size:15px;font-weight:800;color:#16213e;line-height:1.4;\"><span style=\"color:#3f97c9;font-weight:800;\">10.</span> Gartner's 2027 tech trends: AI agent identity management and autonomous exposure remediation<span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#2b7fb0;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:1px 8px;border-radius:20px;margin-left:5px;\">產業</span></div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:13px;color:#5b6470;margin:3px 0 6px;\">Gartner 揭 2027 科技趨勢，AI 代理身分管理與自主曝險修補成資安焦點</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#555c68;line-height:1.55;\">Gartner's top 10 strategic technology trends fall into three themes: nontextual AI, governing autonomous agent platforms, and long-term technological autonomy.</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#8a909c;margin-top:3px;line-height:1.55;\">Gartner 公布 2027 年十大策略科技趨勢，分為非文字型 AI、自主 AI 代理平臺治理，以及強化企業技術自主性與營運韌性三大方向。</div>\n  <div style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:7px;\"><b style=\"color:#3b424f;\">iThome</b> · <a href=\"https://www.ithome.com.tw/news/179893\" style=\"color:#3b6cf6;text-decoration:none;\">原文連結</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;color:#9aa1ad;padding-top:10px;\">由 AI News Digest 從各家 RSS 自動挑選、翻譯並寄送</div>\n</div>\n"}